{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","轮回时阵"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对所有敌人造成伤害并展开魔法阵并持续消耗能量提高激活度，完全激活后加拉哈德额外获得增益。魔法阵持续至加拉哈德离开其中心位置，并且当加拉哈德处于魔法阵中心时释放技能会召唤残影额外模仿自身技能。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用终极技能时，立即消耗400点能量，对所有敌人造成340% + 50% ATK伤害，随后在自身位置展开半径2格的魔法阵持续至自身离开其中心位置。魔法阵持续期间每秒消耗加拉哈德60点能量以提高10%激活度，激活度达到100%后不再消耗能量并使加拉哈德提高30点急速。魔法阵每有10%激活度，使区域内的敌人降低10点急速和16%移动速度，最多降低50点急速和80%移动速度。加拉哈德位于魔法阵中心释放技能后会召唤自身残影再次释放该技能，残影继承自身60% + 5%属性。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":226,"end":231,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至380% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至420% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至460% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至500% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","回溯之缚"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","禁锢累计伤害最高的敌人，失去其累计受到治疗量一部分的生命，随后对更大范围内的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","禁锢敌方累计伤害最高的目标4秒并对其造成210% + 30% ATK伤害，被禁锢的敌人无法行动，同时加拉哈德使其失去上次受到该技能效果后累计受到的非溢出治疗量50%的生命值，最高不超过500% ATK，在挑战首领的模式中，该效果改为固定使敌人失去125% ATK生命值。随后加拉哈德扩大1格伤害范围对并范围内所有敌人造成140% + 20% ATK伤害，重复2次。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":164,"end":170,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":92,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":123,"end":131,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":160,"end":174,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对禁锢目标造成的伤害提高至240% + 30% ATK伤害，扩大攻击范围后造成的伤害提高至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":45,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对禁锢目标造成的伤害提高至270% + 30% ATK伤害，扩大攻击范围后造成的伤害提高至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":45,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对禁锢目标造成的伤害提高至300% + 30% ATK伤害，扩大攻击范围后造成的伤害提高至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["